<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT INDIA BY 38 RUNS IN THIRD TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT INDIA BY 38 RUNS IN THIRD TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat India by 38 runs on the fourth day of the third test at the Kensington Oval on Monday to lead the five-match series 1-0.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 298 and 140; india 319 and 81  (I.Bishop 4-22, F.Rose 3-19, C.Ambrose 3-38).</p>
<p>The fourth test starts in Antigua on Friday.</p>
